# Keep the repository LF everywhere.
#
# Without this, a checkout on Windows converts to CRLF and `npm run format:check`
# fails locally while passing in CI, because Prettier normalises to LF. Pinning
# it here means the formatter, the editor and the Linux runner all agree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
